  actor: 'President Emmanuel Macron and the governments led by Michel Barnier, François Bayrou and Sébastien Lecornu; the National Assembly and its parliamentary groups; the Constitutional Council and Ministry of the Interior; parties, unions, social movements and civil-society actors whose positions are documented in the cited records.',
  historicalSetting: 'The Fifth Republic after the 9 June 2024 dissolution, the 30 June and 7 July legislative elections, fragmented National Assembly, minority governments, censure and confidence votes, and 2025–2026 budget enactment.',
